<view class="container"><view class="eyebrow">SOCIAL CHALLENGE</view><view class="title">找一个理由，坚持下去</view><view class="muted">把一个人的运动，变成一群人的约定。</view><view class="feature card"><view class="feature-top"><text class="feature-tag">热门活动</text><text class="muted small">还有 4 天</text></view><text class="feature-title">秋日校园环线</text><text class="muted small">和 128 位同学一起，完成校园环线打卡</text><view class="row between feature-bottom"><text><text class="feature-number">128</text> 人已参加</text><button class="feature-btn">查看活动</button></view></view><view class="section-title">正在进行</view><block wx:for="{{challenges}}" wx:key="id"><view class="challenge card"><view class="row between"><view class="challenge-icon {{item.tone}}">✦</view><text class="pill">{{item.reward}}</text></view><text class="challenge-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="muted small">{{item.subtitle}}</text><view class="row between progress-label"><text class="muted small">完成进度</text><text class="small">{{item.progressText}}</text></view><view class="progress"><view class="progress-fill" style="width:{{item.progressWidth}}"></view></view><button wx:if="{{!item.joined}}" class="secondary-btn join-btn" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="join">加入挑战</button><view wx:else class="joined">✓ 已加入，继续加油 <text class="leave-link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="leave">退出挑战</text></view></view></block></view>
